(lib/entropy/ is not needed: it is lz6's seq engine, which zpaq-std does not use.)
Used by zpaq-std -ma:lz6 through LZ6_compress_fast_window, LZ6_compress_HC_window
and LZ6_decompress_safe only. The HC block format is lz6's frozen "portable
profile" (same raw block format as LZ5 v1.5), decoded by the ZPAQLZ6 program.
